ning or creating interactive learning materials, our AI service has got you covered.</p>\n              <div className=\"mt-8 flex w-full space-x-8 justify-center\"><a\n                  href=\"/exercises\"><button className=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 border border-transparent text-sm font-medium rounded-md shadow-sm focus ring-2 ring-offset-2 ring-transparent ring-offset-transparent disabled400 appearance-none text-white bg-lime-600 hover700 focus500 focus !px-12 !shadow-lg !rounded-full !text-base\"><p>Start now for free</p></button></a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\nexport { HeroWNavbar }\n",
